Build the game using:

- HTML5.
- CSS.
- JavaScript.
- HTML5 Canvas.

Use vanilla JavaScript unless an external library is genuinely necessary.

The game should run directly in a modern desktop browser.

Use a structured project architecture.

Recommended files:

- index.html
- style.css
- main.js
- physics.js
- mech.js
- proceduralLegs.js
- weapons.js
- enemies.js
- alliedAI.js
- pathfinding.js
- combat.js
- particles.js
- camera.js
- maps.js
- UI.js
- audio.js
