Separate systems into reusable classes and modules.

For example:
- Mech
- MechPhysics
- ProceduralLeg
- LegAnimator
- Weapon
- Projectile
- Enemy
- AlliedUnit
- SquadController
- Camera
- Particle
- MissionManager

Do not place the entire game into one enormous function.

Use a consistent update and rendering system.

